{
  "note": "One judgement per activity and variable the activity-variables guard reports as an unproduced read: a name the workflow file declares with no defaultValue, that no step produces and the server does not seed, so every run reads it unset. An unproduced read no entry covers fails the guard; an entry matching no finding is reported stale and leaves with the change that gives the value its producer. There is no regeneration command.",
  "rationales": {
    "input-without-a-producer": "A value the run needs from outside — usually from the user's request — that no step reads out of the request, asks for at a gate, or derives. Fixed by binding it the way the workflow's first activity binds its other inputs."
  },
